1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:02,680
(Dr Koothrappali:)We heard there was a tornado
in Kansas City.

2
00:00:02,690 --> 00:00:04,320
(Dr Koothrappali:)Is that close to you?

3
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:06,120
(Leonard:)No.

4
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:07,120
(Mrs Koothrappali:)Where is your brother?

5
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,920
(Priya:)Out with friends.

6
00:00:08,930 --> 00:00:11,490
(Dr Koothrappali:)I don't like it, a young girl
alone in an apartment.

7
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,360
(Mrs Koothrappali:)I'll sleep so much better when
you move back here next month.

8
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:15,860
(Leonard:)You're moving
back to India?!

9
00:00:15,870 --> 00:00:17,370
(Dr Koothrappali:)Who's that?

10
00:00:17,370 --> 00:00:19,270
(Mrs Koothrappali:)Oh, my God! There's someone
in your apartment.

11
00:00:19,270 --> 00:00:20,770
(Mrs Koothrappali:)Call the police in America!

12
00:00:20,770 --> 00:00:23,370
When were you going
to tell me about this?

13
00:00:23,370 --> 00:00:25,570
(Priya:)Oh, hello, Leonard.

14
00:00:25,570 --> 00:00:27,070
(Priya:)What a pleasant surprise!

15
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:30,380
(Priya:)Mummy, Daddy, you remember
Rajesh's friend Leonard.

16
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:32,710
(Dr Koothrappali:)I thought you said Rajesh
was out with his friends.

17
00:00:32,710 --> 00:00:34,950
(Priya:)He has many friends.

18
00:00:34,950 --> 00:00:36,550
(Dr Koothrappali:)Rajesh has many friends?

19
00:00:38,190 --> 00:00:40,490
(Mrs Koothrappali:)Why are you lying to us?

20
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:42,790
(Leonard:)She's lying because she doesn't
want you to know we're dating.

21
00:00:42,790 --> 00:00:43,790
(Priya:)Leonard!

22
00:00:43,790 --> 00:00:44,920
(Leonard:)Well, what difference
does it make? If you're

23
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:48,160
(Leonard:)moving back to India,
we're obviously breaking up.

24
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:49,260
(Priya:)You know what?

25
00:00:49,270 --> 00:00:51,630
(Priya:)I don't want to deal
with this right now.

26
00:00:58,210 --> 00:01:00,870
(Leonard:)So...

